<?php if($coverage_active && $user['VerificationStatus']==='verified'):?><p class="alert alert-success">Your recorded verification and fee coverage are current. You can <a href="create-event.php">create an event</a>.</p><?php else:?><p class="alert alert-warning">Your account may need verification review or renewal before creating new events. The annual fee is R99 for 12 months from successfully verified payment. Fee expiry does not automatically change verification status. Existing published events and bookings are preserved, while new bookings are disabled until valid coverage is renewed.</p><?php endif;?>
